     "code": "P376",
     "type": "Term_Browser_Value_Set_Description",
     "value": "This core reference set of NCIt neoplasm classification concepts is designed to facilitate consistent coding, analysis, and data sharing across a broad range of NCI and related resources.  It is intended to include all neoplasms frequently encountered in research and clinical settings, and roughly 80% of infrequent and rare neoplasms encountered in such settings.  Set membership and structure will be extended in response to user feedback.  The initial draft is also available as an Excel file: <a href=\"https://evs.nci.nih.gov/ftp1/NCI_Thesaurus/Neoplasm/Neoplasm_Core.xls\">Neoplasm_Core.xls</a>.  For more details, see the <a href=\"https://evs.nci.nih.gov/ftp1/NCI_Thesaurus/Neoplasm/About_Core.html\">About_Core.html</a> file."
